DEVICE SPIKE

# A deliberately wrong attempt: it waits for the reading to be EXACTLY 20.
# This faster rover skips 20 between sensor samples in this scene and
# drives on into the wall. Equality can sometimes be observed at other speeds.
WHEN flag clicked:
  set movement motors A B
  set movement speed 60
  start moving steering 0
  wait until spike distance D = 20
  stop movement
